   "body": "Capture result (mac/capture-batch, 2026-11-02, PR #394). **Public action:** user1 created the topic `fixture-test` in Programmation › iOS on 2026-11-02 05:35 UTC (https://forum.hardware.fr/hfr/Programmation/iOS/fixture-test-sujet_148785_1.htm), with a neutral text saying it is a developers' test; it was deleted at ~05:47 UTC (the URL now answers 404, `R92`). Captured: `W40` \"Votre message a été posté avec succès !\", refresh to `/hfr/<cat>/liste_sujet-1.htm` (the category, not the sub-category chosen), no topic id. E14 settled in HFR-PROTOCOL.md. Follow-up for LOT-048: see the follow-up issue linked from the PR.",
